## 2. One policy: can(user, action, resource)
   concept: RBAC: a role grants a list of actions; ABAC: a condition on user and resource narrows each one (own record, same organisation, requested by me, pending); no rule means deny
   unknown role "contractor": 0 of 63 cells allowed
   no user: can(null, "member:read", ...) = false; unknown action "member:delete" = false
   action on the wrong kind of resource: can(sam, "member:read", <a contribution>) = false
   a route registered without an action: route DELETE /members/:id declares no action: refusing to start (deny by default)

