== proof: the RLS policies as Postgres stores them ==
    tablename    |       policyname       |  cmd   |                               using                                |                                                                                                                                             with_check                                                                                                                                              
-----------------+------------------------+--------+--------------------------------------------------------------------+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 audit_log       | audit_log_read         | SELECT | (app_role() = 'auditor'::text)                                     | 
 change_requests | change_request_create  | INSERT |                                                                    | ((requested_by = app_user()) AND (status = 'pending'::text) AND (approved_by IS NULL) AND CASE app_role() WHEN 'member'::text THEN (rel(member_id) = 'own record'::text) WHEN 'employer_admin'::text THEN (rel(member_id) = 'same organisation'::text) WHEN 'staff'::text THEN true ELSE false END)
 change_requests | change_request_read    | SELECT | can_read_member_data(member_id)                                    | 
 change_requests | change_request_approve | UPDATE | ((app_role() = 'staff'::text) AND (status = 'pending'::text))      | ((app_role() = 'staff'::text) AND (status = 'approved'::text) AND (approved_by = app_user()) AND (requested_by <> app_user()))
 contributions   | contribution_create    | INSERT |                                                                    | ((app_role() = 'employer_admin'::text) AND (rel(member_id) = 'same organisation'::text))
 contributions   | contribution_read      | SELECT | can_read_member_data(member_id)                                    | 
 members         | member_read            | SELECT | can_read_member_data(id)                                           | 
 members         | member_update          | UPDATE | ((app_role() = 'member'::text) AND (rel(id) = 'own record'::text)) | ((app_role() = 'member'::text) AND (rel(id) = 'own record'::text))
